cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Patient-adaptive conformal prediction sets for reliable single-channel EEG sleep staging"
abstract: >-
  Code and analysis for a study of split conformal prediction on five-class
  Sleep-EDF staging with subject-wise folds. The repository contains the
  smoothed posterior deficit score, per-patient adaptive conformal inference,
  the sequence constructors reported as a negative result, and every script
  that regenerates the tables and figures of the paper.
type: software
